  "body": "Some waterfront opportunities are special. Others are quite simply irreplaceable.\r\n\r\nBordering the reserve and mere footsteps from the beach, this 607sqm flat, north facing freehold site presents a rare opportunity to secure one of Rothesay Bay’s most compelling pieces of coastal real estate.\r\n\r\nHere, the value is in the land. The position, aspect, outlook and proximity to the water are impossible to recreate, while the existing home provides the flexibility to enjoy the property now and consider its future potential.\r\n\r\nPreviously consented architectural plans provide an indication of what could be achieved, while the site's scale and exceptional position invite consideration of a new coastal residence or a more ambitious development, subject to the necessary planning\r\nand Council approvals.\r\n\r\nFor those with vision, this is far more than a home. It is an opportunity to secure a one of-a-kind waterfront holding in a tightly held North Shore location — and create something truly exceptional.\r\n\r\nLive here. Reimagine it. Develop its potential. The choice is yours.\r\n\r\nAll agents welcome - conjunctions invited\r\nMarketed by: Tara Menzies",
